    <!-- ============ Hero ============ -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-blob blob-1"></div>
        <div class="hero-blob blob-2"></div>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-grid">
                <div class="hero-copy">
                    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>次世代終極版佛法・實修真傳</span>
                    <h1 class="hero-title">用現代語言，<br>走一條<span class="grad">究竟解脫</span>之路</h1>
                    <p class="hero-subtitle">從宇宙起源、業力底層邏輯講起，帶你以通俗易懂的方式理解佛法原理，並以實修實證的方法，從零基礎一路修到四禪。</p>
                    <div class="hero-quote">
                        <blockquote>「大家現在能在這裡學習佛法、追求真理和解脫，都是上輩子修來的福報——能遇此妙法，皆是佛前大種福田之人。」</blockquote>
                        <cite>— Tai 師父</cite>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-buttons">
                        <a href="#start" class="btn btn-primary">開始修行之路</a>
